OL,3,ASpeed camera fault may have allowed
OL,4,Adrivers to escape fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office revoked approval that
OL,7,Fallows footage from the cameras to be
OL,8,Fused as evidence in legal proceedings.
OL,9,FUS firm Verra Mobility operates the
OL,10,Fcameras but National Highways said it
OL,11,Fwould now end its contract.
OL,13,FRoads minister Justin Madders said: "We
OL,14,Fcan't take chances with this.
